TEXT 88 128 Left 2 ;Important to set\nalso ohmic resistance\nfor inducances
TEXT 440 -64 Left 2 ;Computation: 600Hz Filter\nf=50 Harmonics 11,13Hz\nVLL=400kV/50Hz V0=VLL/sqrt(3)=231kV\nQB=50(30-60) Filter quality factor\nQF=100MVar (Filter reactive power at 50Hz)\nh=12 (harmonics)\nfh=h*f=600\nXC=3*V0*V0/QF600=19200\nC=1/omega/XC=0.166u=166nF\nL=1/(2*%pi*fh)^2/C=0.4244H\nXL=2*%pi*fh*L=1600\nC50=C*h=1.989u\nL50=L/h=0.03537H\nRL=XL/QB=1600/50=32Ohm\n \nIfilt50=V0/XC50=144A\nQfilt50=3*Ifilt50*Ifilt50*XC50=72.9MVAr\nQfilt550=3*V0*V0/XC1=6.6MVAr
